  "description": "DEFC.Util.RepoGen is a code generation tool for .NET that automates the creation of repositories and unit of work implementations based on stored procedures. It reduces boilerplate, enforces clean architecture principles, and accelerates development by mapping database logic into well-structured repository classes. Ideal for teams using Microsoft SQL Server with Entity Framework Core in layered or hexagonal architectures.",
